# 7. Identity Matrix

```python
I = np.eye(3)
```

Identity Matrix:

[
\begin{bmatrix}
1&0&0\
0&1&0\
0&0&1
\end{bmatrix}
]

Output:

```python
[[1. 0. 0.]
 [0. 1. 0.]
 [0. 0. 1.]]
```

### Why Important?

Just like multiplying a number by 1:

```python
5 × 1 = 5
```

Similarly:

```python
A × I = A
```

Identity matrix does not change the matrix.

